:"Silken Moon's Serenade","r":[0.5065,0.5704,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"a"},{"n":"Varunada Lazurite Gemstone","r":[0.0815,0.6785,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"m"},{"n":"Perpetual Caliber","r":[0.5065,0.6785,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"m"},{"n":"Philosophies of Praxis","r":[0.0815,0.7319,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"m"},{"n":"Crystalline Cyst Dust","r":[0.5065,0.7319,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"m"},{"n":"Padisarah","r":[0.0815,0.7852,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"m"},{"n":"Tears of the Calamitous God","r":[0.5065,0.7852,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"m"},{"n":"Crown of Insight","r":[0.0815,0.8385,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"m"}]},{"img":"content/genshin/builds/nilou/261111-225142/zh-3.webp","t":"content/genshin/builds/nilou/261111-225142/zh-3.t.webp","w":1080,"h":1350,"kind":"why","links":[{"n":"Key of Khaj-Nisut","r":[0.1093,0.2419,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"w"},{"n":"Primordial Jade Cutter","r":[0.1093,0.2878,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"w"},{"n":"Freedom-Sworn","r":[0.1093,0.3337,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"w"},{"n":"Tenacity of the Millelith","r":[0.0815,0.4404,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"a"},{"n":"Vourukasha's Glow","r":[0.1343,0.4404,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"a"},{"n":"Tenacity of the Millelith","r":[0.0815,0.5011,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"a"},{"n":"Wanderer's Troupe","r":[0.1343,0.5011,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"a"},{"n":"Silken Moon's Serenade","r":[0.0815,0.5693,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"a"},{"n":"Nilou","r":[0.0815,0.6867,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Sangonomiya Kokomi","r":[0.1259,0.6867,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Lauma","r":[0.1704,0.6867,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.2148,0.6867,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Nilou","r":[0.0815,0.7407,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Xingqiu","r":[0.1259,0.7407,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1704,0.7407,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Baizhu","r":[0.2148,0.7407,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Nilou","r":[0.0815,0.7948,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Nefer","r":[0.1259,0.7948,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Lauma","r":[0.1704,0.7948,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Columbina","r":[0.2148,0.7948,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Nilou","r":[0.0815,0.8489,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Barbara","r":[0.1259,0.8489,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Collei","r":[0.2148,0.8489,0.037,0.0296]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/nilou/261111-225142/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Key of Khaj-Nisut","text":"Best overall. Huge HP increases Bountiful Core DMG, while its Skill-triggered passive shares EM."},{"name":"Primordial Jade Cutter","text":"Its passive adds HP, but the CR secondary stat does not help Bountiful Core DMG. A usable premium option without Key."},{"name":"Freedom-Sworn","text":"High EM helps Nilou-owned Blooms & its passive can buff teammates. Lacks HP%, so her Bountiful Core bonus will be lower."},{"name":"The Dockhand's Assistant","text":"Excellent 4-star HP% sword."},{"name":"Xiphos' Moonlight","text":"Provides EM for Nilou-owned Blooms and shares ER with the team. Still prioritize HP on artifacts."},{"name":"Serenity's Call","text":"Great craftable HP option when Nilou triggers reactions. Its HP passive is stronger in teams with Ascendant Gleam. Needs a reaction to activate HP buff."},{"name":"Iron Sting","text":"Accessible craftable sword with EM for Blooms Nilou triggers. Its damage passive does not boost Bountiful Cores."},{"name":"Sapwood Blade","text":"F2P sword that can create an EM leaf for the teammate triggering Blooms. ER is convenient but not required for Nilou."}],"a":[{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith","Vourukasha's Glow"],"text":"Best general Bountiful Bloom setup. The combined 40% HP strengthens Nilou’s teamwide core damage bonus.","stats":"HP% / HP% / HP%"},{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith","Wanderer's Troupe"],"text":"Alternative HP and EM mix when pieces have better substats. Prioritize HP until Nilou reaches her Bloom bonus cap.","stats":"HP% / HP% / HP%"},{"names":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"text":"Use in Nefer Lunar-Bloom teams if nobody else carries it. Adds team EM and Lunar-Bloom buffs instead of stacking HP.","stats":"HP% / HP% / HP% (flexible)"}],"t":[{"name":"Lotus Bloom Royalty","members":["Nilou","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Lauma","Nahida"],"text":"Kokomi drives Blooms and heals core self-DMG.","roles":["Bloom Buffer / Hydro Enabler","Healer / Hydro Enabler","Dendro Buffer / Enabler","Dendro Enabler / Buffer"]},{"name":"Garden of Deep Waters","members":["Nilou","Xingqiu","Nahida","Baizhu"],"text":"Nahida drives Blooms using Xingqiu’s Hydro. Baizhu keeps the team healthy.","roles":["Bloom Buffer / Hydro Enabler","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Shielder"]},{"name":"Moonlit Lotus","members":["Nilou","Nefer","Lauma","Columbina"],"text":"Nilou applies Hydro for Nefer’s Lunar-Bloom DMG. Lauma and Columbina provide Lunar buffs.","roles":["Bloom Buffer / Hydro Enabler","On-field DPS","Dendro Buffer / Enabler","Off-field DPS / Buffer"]},{"name":"Budget Flower Power","members":["Nilou","Barbara","Traveler (Dendro)","Collei"],"text":"Barbara heals and triggers Blooms on-field. Dendro Traveler and Collei apply Dendro.","roles":["Bloom Buffer / Hydro Enabler","Healer","Dendro Enabler / Battery","Dendro Enabler"]}],"v":"Standard Bountiful Bloom: Use two HP% sets and three HP% main stats. Reach as close to 74,444 HP as possible with buffs and Hydro Resonance.\nF2P Bloom: Use Serenity’s Call or Iron Sting with HP artifacts.\nLunar-Bloom Support: In Nefer teams, Bountiful Cores are replaced by Seeds of Deceit.\nNilou Bloom Ownership: If Nilou triggers many Blooms, EM becomes more valuable after you secure strong HP.\nComfort Rotation: Use Skill then three Whirling Steps for her Hydro aura. Her Burst is optional, so do not sacrifice HP to force it.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Sub DPS"],"about":"Nilou transforms ordinary Bloom into fast, powerful Bountiful Cores when her party uses only Hydro and Dendro. Stack HP to strengthen the whole team’s Bloom damage, and bring a healer for core self-damage. She can also support Lunar-Bloom teams, which require a different setup.","pros":["Powerful Bountiful Cores","Excellent AoE DMG","Strong F2P teams","Low talent investment","Flexible Dendro partners"],"cons":["Hydro/Dendro t